+ * The touch screen's bus, read only. The touch chip (sec,sec_ts at 0x48, firmware y79a) is on hsi2c15 at
+ * 0x108D0000 (USI07's I2C, in PERIC1); its interrupt line is GPA1-0 (alive pin controller, low = an event waits);
